## Module 4 — Command Selection (`src/command_selector.py`)

Implements both algorithms **verbatim** as a baseline (Meena's contribution, not ours):

**Algorithm 1 — Asynchronous:**
```
α = 6
For each frame t in [0, Δt1]:
  Lp = argmax(β_left predictions)
  Rp = argmax(β_right predictions)
  if Lp == Rp and Lp != 4 (centre): selected_t = Rp
  else: selected_t = None
  if selected_t == selected_{t-1}: δ += 1
  else: δ = 0
if δ >= Δt1: fire command; reset δ
```

**Algorithm 2 — Synchronous:**
```
α = 6, Weights[1..N] = 0
For each frame t in [0, Δt2]:
  if Lp == Rp != centre: Weights[Rp] += √t
selected = argmax(Weights)
P = max(Weights) / mean(Weights)
if P >= α: fire command
```

