## Module 5 — Keyboard GUI (`src/keyboard_gui.py`)

**Tkinter layout — same 3×3 grid as the paper (this is the baseline):**
- 9 command boxes at NW/N/NE/W/C/E/SW/S/SE positions
- Level 1: 7 character-group commands + Go-Back (C5) + Delete (C9)
- Level 2: 8 letters per command
- White → green border on focus; `pyttsx3` audio on selection
- Last 5 typed letters shown below each box

**NEW — Prediction Slots (our addition, not in the paper):**
- After each letter typed, query `predictor.py` for top-3 word completions
- 3 prediction boxes appear above/below the main grid, gaze-selectable
- Selecting a prediction inserts the full word (bypassing letter-by-letter spelling)
- Prediction slots update in real time as user types
- Can be toggled ON/OFF via a gaze-hold on a "PRED" toggle button — allows direct A/B comparison

